              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanamandla phakathi kwamaqhawe bayakukhuluma kuye beseHayidese nabasizayo: Behlile, balele bengasokile, bebulewe ngenkemba.",
