        },
        {
          "text": "Kukhona i-Elamu naso sonke isixuku salo nxazonke zethuna lalo, bonke ababuleweyo, abawe ngenkemba, abehlele ezindaweni eziphansi zomhlaba bengasokile, ababangele ukwesaba ezweni labaphilayo; nokho bathwala ihlazo labo kanye nabehlela egodini.",
