        },
        {
          "text": "Bammisela umbhede phakathi kwababuleweyo kanye nesixuku sakhe sonke; amathuna akhe nxazonke zakhe: bonke abangasokile, ababulewe ngenkemba; nakuba besatshwe ezweni labaphilayo, bathwala ihlazo labo kanye nabehlela egodini; Ubekwe phakathi kwabanqotshiwe.",
