              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukhona uMesheki, noThubali, nesixuku sakhe sonke; amathuna akhe angakubo nxazonke, bonke abangasokile, ababulewe ngenkemba, nakuba babebanga ukwesaba ezweni labaphilayo.",
          "type": "text",
