              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ngeke babe nobudlelwane nabanamandla abawa kwabangasokile abehlele ezansi esihogweni nezikhali zabo zempi; babeke izinkemba zabo phansi kwamakhanda abo, kepha ububi babo buyakuba phezu kwamathambo abo, nakuba babesaba abanamandla ezweni labaphilayo.",
          "type": "text",
