        },
        {
          "text": "Kukhona u-Edomi, amakhosi akhe nazo zonke izikhulu zakhe, abachithwa ngamandla abo ngenkemba; bayolala nabangasokile kanye nalabo abehlela egodini.",
          "type": "text",
