              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukhona izikhulu zasenyakatho, zonke, nabo bonke abaseSidoni abehla nababuleweyo; ngokwesaba kwabo bajabhile ngamandla abo; balele bengasokile nababulewe ngenkemba, bathwele ihlazo labo kanye nabehlela egodini.",
