          "text": "Ngoba ngenzé ukwesabeka kwami ezweni labaphilayo, futhi uyolaliswa phakathi kwabangasokile kanye nalabo ababulewe ngenkemba, okungukuthi uFaro naso sonke isixuku sakhe, isho iNkosi uJehova.",
